},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"type":"topic","title":"MLNShapeSource","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorStyleLayer/predicate":{"type":"topic","title":"predicate","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The style layer’s predicate.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"predicate"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectorstylelayer\/predicate","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer\/predicate"}}}